<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89774" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσνεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>incline</i> or <i>bend towards</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>have an inclination</i> or <i>tendency</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ προσνεύσαντος οὐδὲ βουληθέντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					5.1.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>incline, slope towards</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				154.5
			</span></i>; <i>lean towards</i>, in wrestling, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.142
			</span></i> (
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προν-</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.32.4
			</span></i>; <i>look towards</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λιβύη π. ἐπὶ τὸν ἄρκτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.4.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.1.68
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσνεῦον τὸ ἀπαρέμφατον ἀμφοτέραις
					ταῖς αἰτιατικαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					243.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>approach</i>, of planets, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				7.14
			</span></i>,al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
